{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2022-12-05 08:00:00', 'title': 'AGILENT OPENS CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE CENTER HIGHLIGHTING GENOMICS AND DIAGNOSTICS SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES INC. (NYSE: A) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF A NEW CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE CENTER (CEC) IN LEXINGTON, MA, FOCUSED ON SOLUTIONS FROM AGILENT GENOMICS AND DIAGNOSTICS PRODUCT PORTFOLIOS. THE FACILITY WILL SERVE AS A REGIONAL HUB FOR AGILENT REPRESENTATIVES TO SHOWCASE AND DEMONSTRATE BOTH PRODUCT CAPABILITIES AND COMPLETE WORKFLOW SOLUTIONS TO CUSTOMERS.'}{'symbol': 'ARE', 'date': '2022-12-05 08:30:00', 'title': 'ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. DECLARES CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.21 PER COMMON SHARE FOR 4Q22, AN INCREASE OF 3 CENTS OVER 3Q22, AND AN AGGREGATE OF $4.72 PER COMMON SHARE FOR 2022, UP 24 CENTS, OR 5 PERCENT, OVER 2021', 'text': 'PASADENA, CALIF. , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. (NYSE: ARE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.21 PER COMMON SHARE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022.'}{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2022-12-05 07:00:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTS LONG-STANDING MEMBER KIRK S. HACHIGIAN AS CHAIRMAN', 'text': 'DUBLIN--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS (“BOARD”) OF ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE), A LEADING GLOBAL SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, HAS ELECTED KIRK S. HACHIGIAN AS ITS NEXT CHAIRMAN, EFFECTIVE JAN. 1, 2023. HACHIGIAN HAS SERVED AS A MEMBER OF THE BOARD SINCE ALLEGION BECAME A STANDALONE COMPANY IN 2013, AND WILL SUCCEED DAVID D. PETRATIS, WHO IS RETIRING FROM THE ROLE AS OF DEC. 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'AMCR', 'date': '2022-12-05 09:34:00', 'title': 'AMCOR DRIVES PROGRESS ON ADVANCED RECYCLING MATERIALS FOR FOOD AND HEALTHCARE MARKETS', 'text': "FIVE-YEAR DEAL TO SECURE THOUSANDS OF TONS OF HIGH-PERFORMANCE, CERTIFIED-CIRCULAR MATERIAL FROM EXXONMOBIL'S ADVANCED RECYCLING PLANT ZURICH , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE / --\xa0