OR TOOLS FOR GF 22FDX® PLATFORM', 'text': "FOUNDRY CERTIFICATION ENABLES GF 22FDX CUSTOMERS TO VALIDATE THEIR CHIP DESIGNS' POWER INTEGRITY AND RELIABILITY WITH ANSYS GOLDEN SIGNOFF TOOLS / KEY HIGHLIGHTS ANSYS® REDHAWK-SC™, ANSYS® RAPTORH™ AND ANSYS® HFSS™ CERTIFIED AS SIGNOFF SOLUTIONS FOR GF'S FLAGSHIP 22FDX PLATFORM CHIP DESIGNERS RELY ON THE PREDICTIVE ACCURACY OF ANSYS' INDUSTRY-LEADING SIGNOFF TOOLS TO REDUCE THE COST AND INCREASE THE PERFORMANCE OF THEIR 22FDX DESIGNS WITH CONFIDENCE PITTSBURGH , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ANSYS\xa0(NASDAQ: ANSS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GF HAS CERTIFIED ANSYS® REDHAWK-SC™, ANSYS® RAPTORH™ AND ANSYS® HFSS™ SEMICONDUCTOR TOOLS\xa0FOR ITS FLAGSHIP 22FDX PLATFORM. THE GF CERTIFICATION ENABLES CHIP DESIGNERS TO REDUCE COSTS BY ELIMINATING WASTEFUL SAFETY MARGINS AND IMPROVING SYSTEM PERFORMANCE, WITHOUT COMPROMISING RELIABILITY OR RISKING UNEXPECTED AND DAMAGING INTERACTIONS BETWEEN DESIGN ELEMENTS."}{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2022-12-05 10:51:00', 'title': 'DELAWARE COUNTY, INDIANA PLANS TO DELIVER AT&T FIBER-POWERED BROADBAND TO NEARLY 1,250 CUSTOMER LOCATIONS', 'text': 'PLANS CALL FOR AT&T FIBER WITH SPEEDS OF UP TO 5 GIGS TO HELP CLOSE THE DIGITAL DIVIDE MUNCIE, IND. , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DELAWARE COUNTY, INDIANA, TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS FOR A $2.3 MILLION PROJECT WITH AT&T* TO BUILD A STATE-OF-THE-ART NETWORK AND DELIVER AT&T FIBERSM \xa0TO SOME 1,250 CUSTOMER LOCATIONS IN PARTS OF THE COUNTY.'}{'symbol': 'AVY', 'date': '2022-12-05 06:45:00', 'title': 'AVERY DENNISON ANNOUNCES UPCOMING INVESTOR EVENT', 'text': 'MENTOR, OHIO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AVERY DENNISON CORPORATION (NYSE: AVY) ANNOUNCED THAT MITCH BUTIER, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT HOSTED BY BANK OF AMERICA ON THURSDAY, DECEMBER 8, AT 11:00 AM ET.'}{'symbol': 'AXON', 'date': '2022-12-05 17:00:00', 'title': 'AXON ANNOUNCES PROPOSED CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES OFFERING', 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ. , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/