W, STATE-OF-THE-ART MULTIPURPOSE COMMUNITY CENTER IN UVALDE, TEXAS.'}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-12-05 10:05:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK EXPANDS SOUTHEAST MARKET PRESENCE INTO SOUTH CAROLINA, GEORGIA', 'text': 'DALLAS , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DEMONSTRATING ITS COMMITMENT TO DRIVING GROWTH THROUGH STRATEGIC INVESTMENTS, COMERICA BANK ANNOUNCED THE EXPANSION OF ITS NEW SOUTHEAST MARKET WITH THE RECENT ADDITION OF OFFICES IN TWO STATES NEW TO ITS REGIONAL FOOTPRINT – SOUTH CAROLINA AND GEORGIA. EXPANSION ACROSS THE SOUTHEAST HAS REMAINED A FOCUS FOR COMERICA SINCE IT REVEALED THE CREATION OF ITS SOUTHEAST MARKET IN AUGUST 2021.'}{'symbol': 'CPRT', 'date': '2022-12-03 07:15:00', 'title': 'COPART ANNOUNCES HIRING OF NEW CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER', 'text': 'DALLAS , DEC. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COPART, INC. (NASDAQ: CPRT) ANNOUNCED THE ADDITION OF TWO NEW MEMBERS TO ITS LEADERSHIP TEAM TODAY: CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER LEAH STEARNS AND CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER PAUL KIRKPATRICK.'}{'symbol': 'DPZ', 'date': '2022-12-05 07:30:00', 'title': "DOMINO'S® RELEASES 2022 STEWARDSHIP REPORT", 'text': "ENVIRONMENTAL AND INCLUSIVITY GOALS OUTLINED IN NEW REPORT ANN ARBOR, MICH. , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINO'S PIZZA INC. (NYSE: DPZ), THE LARGEST PIZZA COMPANY IN THE WORLD, HAS PUBLISHED ITS 2022 CORPORATE STEWARDSHIP REPORT, WHICH REFLECTS DOMINO'S STEWARDSHIP VISION\xa0TO PROVIDE THE POWER OF POSSIBLE EVERY DAY FOR THE COMMUNITIES WE SERVE, OUR PEOPLE AND THE PLANET."}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2022-12-05 15:07:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY RESTORES THOUSANDS OF CUSTOMERS AFTER SUBSTATION VANDALISM IN N.C.', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUKE ENERGY CREWS HAVE RESTORED POWER TO NEARLY 7,000 CUSTOMERS SINCE SUNDAY NIGHT WHEN SUBSTATIONS IN MOORE COUNTY WERE ATTACKED.'}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2022-12-05 14:00:00', 'title': "DUKE ENERGY'S CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER DHIAA JAMIL TO RETIRE IN 2023", 'text': 'CHIEF GENERATION OFFICER 